    "notes": {
        "53573c9b-acdf-4290-afd6-336910de2c39": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": 528,
            "width": 672,
            "height": 224,
            "content": "## ⚠️ Test data assumption\n\nThe workspace needs **at least one template**, and the first template List Templates returns must accept a recipient **without a role** (a template with no roles, or one whose fields are not assigned to a role). Otherwise PandaDoc rejects the document. Create such a template in PandaDoc (Templates → New template) before running the flow."
        }
